    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "SYSTEM TIMETABLE\nEffective January 22, 1982\nINTRODUCING LOW FARE JET SERVICE\nTO THE WEST",
      "NEW LOW-FARE JET SERVICE FOR THE WEST\nALL FLIGHTS PROVIDED WITH ROLLS ROYCE POWERED ONE ELEVEN TWIN JETS.\nPORTLAND\nBOISE\nMEDFORD\nSAN FRANCISCO\nCHICO\nSAN JOSE\nOAKLAND\nRESERVATIONS\nBoise\nChico\nMedford\nOakland\nPalm Springs\nPortland\nSan Francisco\nSan Jose\n800-824-9129\n916-893-4929\n800-824-9129\n415-836-6176\n800-822-8181\n800-824-9129\n415-362-0676\n408-293-2199\nLOS ANGELES\n(coming soon)\nPALM SPRINGS\nEXPRESS FARES (Including Tax)\nCities\nBoise-Chico\nBoise-Medford\nBoise-Palm Springs\nBoise-Portland\nBoise-San Francisco\nChico-Palm Springs\nChico-Portland\nChico-San Francisco\nMedford-Portland\nOakland-Palm Springs\nOakland-San Jose\nPalm Springs-Portland\nPalm Springs-San Francisco\nPalm Springs-San Jose\nPortland-San Francisco\nPeak\n$128.\n148.\n168.\n89.\n99.\n98.\n128.\n55.\n79.\n69.\n10.\n119.\n69.\n69.\n99.\nOff Peak\n$ 98.\n128.\n118.\n69.\n69.\n78.\n98.\n29.\n59.\n49.\n99.\n49.\n49.\n69."
